ppy Birthday, Sana!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wow!!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sana stares at the cake in front of her in disbelief. A number 9 candle, lit and flickering, stands atop the tempting sugar glaze."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a birthday cake..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ramzan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, it's bad enough you keep bringing this American brat home all the time—now you're throwing her a birthday party too?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":33,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The door is that way."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ramzan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't need you to tell me!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Open","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Close","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bam! Ramzan slams the door on his way out."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No one in the room seems surprised. The warm, cozy atmosphere remains undisturbed."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":33,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why isn't your mom here yet?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ahmin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Armin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've double-checked with Ms. Meitner... a few times..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's okay. She probably won't come."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sana is still gazing dreamily at the cake."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ahmin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Armin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But it is your birthday today."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mama's been even busier lately. But during my last summer break in primary school, she took me to the botanical garden!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We saw so many beautiful plants—I'm really happy with that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":33,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You skipped straight to middle school, you know. That means you lost a bunch of summer and winter breaks."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't mind~ I'm super happy now!"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I get to see you guys all the time, and my new classmates aren't as mean as the ones in primary school."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They would at least come and borrow my notes or homework every now and then."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":33,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ahmin","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Armin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What was your favorite flower from the botanical garden?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bellium minutum L.!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ahmin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Armin","narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ahmin","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Armin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's usually called a miniature daisy, but Mama says using the Latin name is more accurate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":37,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What kind of nonsense is your mom teaching you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,210"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's not hard! Bellium means it's from the daisy genus, minutum means it's really small, and L. is the abbreviation for Carl Linnaeus, the botanist."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":36,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ahmin","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Armin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, come on, make your wish and blow out the candle!"